---

Standard Response Format

Every successful response:

{
  "success": true,
  "data": {},
  "meta": {
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "timestamp": "2026-08-06T19:00:00Z"
  }
}


---

Errors:

{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "PLUGIN_NOT_FOUND",
    "message": "Plugin does not exist."
  }
}


---

Health Endpoint

GET /health

Returns:

{
  "status": "healthy",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "uptime": 12345
}


---

Status Endpoint

GET /status

Returns:

{
  "project": "Smart Property",
  "framework": "Next.js",
  "database": "MySQL",
  "orm": "Prisma",
  "analysis": {
    "healthScore": 92,
    "modules": 11
  }
}


---

Analyze Project

POST /analysis

Request:

{
  "path": "/projects/smart-property"
}

Response:

{
  "analysisId": "anl_12345",
  "status": "completed"
}


---

Context Endpoint

