---

Guiding Principle

> "Every endpoint should return knowledge, not just data."



The Ohira API is not simply a REST service; it is the primary interface through which software projects become understandable to people, applications, and AI systems.


---

MVP Endpoints

For Ohira v0.1, the required endpoints are:

GET /health

GET /status

POST /analysis

GET /context

GET /reports

GET /plugins

GET /metrics

GET /projects/current


These provide enough functionality for Ohira to serve as the intelligence layer for Smart Property and other early adopter projects.
